<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Designer Deck Template v1</title>
    <style>
      @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap");

      :root {
        --ink: #111111;
        --muted: #6f7785;
        --line: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
        --blue-primary: #4A89C8;
        --blue-gradient-start: #5A99D8;
        --blue-gradient-end: #3A79B8;
        --gray-bg: #F8F9FA;
        --gray-border: #E5E7EB;
        --gray-text: #9CA3AF;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        width: 1920px;
        height: 1080px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #ffffff;
        font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .slide {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: #ffffff;
      }

      .header {
        position: absolute;
        left: 92px;
        top: 62px;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 64px;
        line-height: 1.04;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }

      .segment-history {
        position: absolute;
        left: 182px;
        top: 290px;
        width: 480px;
        height: 140px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue-gradient-start) 0%, var(--blue-gradient-end) 100%);
        border-radius: 16px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 48px rgba(58, 121, 184, 0.25);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        z-index: 10;
      }

      .history-label {
        font-size: 36px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #ffffff;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .history-support {
        position: absolute;
        left: 182px;
        top: 454px;
        width: 480px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--blue-gradient-end);
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }

      .segment-exam {
        position: absolute;
        left: 700px;
        top: 320px;
        width: 280px;
        height: 80px;
        background: var(--gray-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);
        border-radius: 8px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--gray-text);
        box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
      }

      .segment-decisions {
        position: absolute;
        left: 996px;
        top: 320px;
        width: 444px;
        height: 80px;
        background: var(--gray-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);
        border-radius: 8px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--gray-text);
        box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
      }

      .proof-field {
        position: absolute;
        left: 700px;
        top: 454px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 48px;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--gray-border);
        padding-left: 36px;
      }

      .proof-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        position: relative;
      }

      .proof-row::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: -46px;
        top: 6px;
        width: 16px;
        height: 16px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 4px solid var(--blue-primary);
      }

      .proof-title {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--ink);
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }

      .proof-desc {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.5;
        max-width: 540px;
      }

      .bottom-section {
        position: absolute;
        left: 182px;
        top: 780px;
        width: 1258px;
        padding-top: 40px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-border);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .bottom-statement {
        font-size: 44px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--ink);
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      }

      .bottom-support {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--muted);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .bottom-support span {
        color: #D1D5DB;
        font-size: 20px;
      }

      .footer-line {
        position: absolute;
        left: 112px;
        top: 992px;
        width: 1536px;
        height: 1px;
        background: var(--line);
      }

      .footer-logo {
        position: absolute;
        left: 1692px;
        top: 962px;
        width: 114px;
        height: 59px;
        object-fit: contain;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <section class="slide" aria-label="History is the cleanest place to reclaim minutes">
      <h1 class="header">History is the cleanest place to reclaim minutes.</h1>

      <div class="segment-history">
        <span class="history-label">History</span>
      </div>
      <div class="history-support">A high-leverage target for pre-visit prep.</div>

      <div class="segment-exam">Physical exam</div>
      <div class="segment-decisions">Decisions + counseling</div>

      <div class="proof-field">
        <div class="proof-row">
          <div class="proof-title">Foundational to the encounter</div>
          <div class="proof-desc">Shapes the starting point for what follows in the visit.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-row">
          <div class="proof-title">Time-variable</div>
          <div class="proof-desc">Time required depends on complexity, communication, and context.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-row">
          <div class="proof-title">Can begin before the encounter</div>
          <div class="proof-desc">A meaningful portion can start before the clinician is on the clock.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-section">
        <div class="bottom-statement">But reclaiming those minutes still requires clinical judgment.</div>
        <div class="bottom-support">Relevant details <span>&bull;</span> Timeline <span>&bull;</span> Next questions</div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <img
        class="footer-logo"
        src="../../../../assets/logo/designer-health-logo-black.svg"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </section>
  </body>
</html>
```
